---
import DefaultLayout from '@layouts/DefaultLayout.astro'
---

<DefaultLayout
  title="About"
  description="About J. Dylan Beckham — PMP-certified project professional combining project management, operations, business analytics, and technical fluency."
>
  <section class="my-24">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <p class="mb-4 text-lg font-semibold">About</p>

        <h1 class="mb-10 text-5xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-7xl">
          I work best where the objective is clear,
          <span class="text-gradient"> but the path is not.</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-6 text-xl leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            My background combines project management, operations, business
            analytics, technical problem-solving, and entrepreneurship, giving
            me experience working with incomplete information, competing
            priorities, limited resources, and real operational constraints.
          </p>

          <p>
            I bring structure to that ambiguity by defining the work,
            identifying what matters, creating measurable ways to evaluate
            progress, and coordinating execution toward an outcome.
          </p>

          <p>
            My current professional development builds on that operating
            experience with PMP certification and graduate study in Business
            Analytics, while strengthening practical capability in SQL,
            Python, data visualization, process analysis, and decision support.
          </p>

          <p>
            The objective is not simply to produce analysis or administer a
            project plan, but to connect information, people, process, and
            execution so that better decisions lead to tangible results.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="my-32">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <h2 class="mb-10 text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl">
          How I Work
        </h2>

        <p class="mb-10 max-w-4xl text-xl leading-relaxed">
          My work tends to follow a consistent progression:
        </p>

        <p class="text-2xl font-bold">
          Structure → Measure → Decide → Execute → Improve
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="my-32">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <h2 class="mb-10 text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl">
          Professional Focus
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <article class="border-t pt-6">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">
              Project Management
            </h3>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
              Requirements, scope, schedules, stakeholders, risks,
              dependencies, change, quality, and structured delivery.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="border-t pt-6">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">
              Business Analysis
            </h3>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
              Clarifying problems, translating stakeholder needs, defining
              workflows, documenting requirements, and improving processes.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="border-t pt-6">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">
              Analytics &amp; Decision Support
            </h3>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
              KPIs, operational reporting, forecasting, dashboards, data
              visualization, and analytical interpretation.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="border-t pt-6">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold">
              Operations &amp; Technical Fluency
            </h3>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
              Practical execution supported by Python, SQL, data workflows,
              technical tools, and experience operating under real constraints.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="my-32">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
        <h2 class="mb-10 text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl">
          Credentials
        </h2>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-xl leading-relaxed">
          <li><strong>PMP certification</strong></li>
          <li><strong>CAPM certification</strong></li>
          <li><strong>FAA Part 107</strong></li>
          <li>
            University of North Texas graduate —
            Bachelor’s of AAS in Information Technologies, Data Analytics,
            and Graphic Design
          </li>
          <li>
            University of North Texas —
            M.S. in Business Analytics in progress
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</DefaultLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .text-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(
      315deg,
      light-dark(var(--color-primary-300), var(--color-secondary-100)) 25%,
      light-dark(var(--color-secondary-300), var(--color-primary-200))
    );
    background-clip: border-box;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
</style>